{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":76,"count":30,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-3-01\",\"興趣\",\"興趣\",\"兴趣\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的興趣是運動，打網球、游泳，我都喜歡。","pinyin":"Wǒ de xìngqù shì yùndòng, dǎ wǎngqiú, yóuyǒng, wǒ dōu xǐhuān.","english":"My hobby is doing exercise. I like both tennis and swimming.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-01","sourceFront":"興趣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"興(interest) + 趣(interest) → interest, doubled: 興趣(interest; hobby)."},{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-03\",\"头发\",\"頭髮\",\"头发\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"聽說坐月子時不能洗頭髮，要不然對身體不好，你相信這樣的說法嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-14","sourceFront":"說法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天空突然下起了大雨，我的衣服和頭髮都濕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-20","sourceFront":"溼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的朋友會理頭髮，為了省錢我們常常去找他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-17","sourceFront":"理頭髮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的白髮隨著年齡越來越多了，我想找一天去染頭髮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-49","sourceFront":"染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想捐頭髮，長度至少要十五公分以上才能捐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-26","sourceFront":"捐","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-3-12\",\"蛇\",\"蛇\",\"蛇\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個孩子可真勇敢！連看到蛇也不害怕。","pinyin":"Nàge háizi kě zhēn yǒnggǎn! Lián kàn dào shé yě bú hàipà.","english":"That child is certainly brave! He is not even afraid when he sees a snake.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-01","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我把房間裡那條黑色繩子看成蛇，嚇了我一大跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-17","sourceFront":"繩子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"早上在草地上散步，突然看見一條蛇經過，害得我一直流冷汗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-28","sourceFront":"冷汗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"動物的體溫不見得都是不變的，像蛇的體溫就隨著環境而變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-48","sourceFront":"體溫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"an 虫(insect) curls around an 它(it) shape in the grass → 蛇(snake)."},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-23\",\"扫地\",\"掃地\",\"扫地\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"暑假的時候，我跟弟弟一起做家事。我掃地，他洗碗筷。","pinyin":"Shǔjià de shíhou, wǒ gēn dìdi yīqǐ zuò jiāshì. Wǒ sǎo dì, tā xǐ wǎnkuài.","english":"During summer vacation, I do housework together with my younger brother. I sweep the floor, and he washes the dishes.","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-25","sourceFront":"暑假","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"媽媽說要把房間打掃得乾乾淨淨的，這樣才能開開心心地過年。","pinyin":"Māma shuō yào bǎ fángjiān dǎsǎo de gāngānjìngjìng de, zhèyàng cái néng kāikāixīnxīn de guònián.","english":"Mom said to clean the room spotlessly clean, so that we can celebrate the New Year happily.","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-05","sourceFront":"寒假","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽說要把房間打掃得乾乾淨淨的，這樣才能開開心心地過年。","pinyin":"Māma shuō yào bǎ fángjiān dǎsǎo de gāngānjìngjìng de, zhèyàng cái néng kāikāixīnxīn de guònián.","english":"Mom said to clean the room spotlessly clean, so that we can celebrate the New Year happily.","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-06","sourceFront":"過年","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-2-10\",\"顺利\",\"順利\",\"顺利\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次的旅行很順利，沒有什麼問題。","pinyin":"Zhè cì de lǚxíng hěn shùnlì, méiyǒu shénme wèntí.","english":"This trip was very smooth; there were no problems.","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-10","sourceFront":"順利","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"畢業後能順利找到好工作，是很多大學生的希望。","pinyin":"Bìyè hòu néng shùnlì zhǎodào hǎo gōngzuò, shì hěn duō dàxuéshēng de xīwàng.","english":"Being able to smoothly find a good job after graduation is the hope of many university students.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-26","sourceFront":"希望","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過教授的介紹，我一畢業就順利地找到了滿意的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-02","sourceFront":"透過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小明順利通過了大學考試，今年就是一年級的新生了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-21","sourceFront":"通過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸常教導我做人要謙虛，太驕傲的話，不僅讓人討厭，做事也可能不順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-15","sourceFront":"驕傲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路邊的攝影機錄到了房先生發生車禍的經過，讓警察順利抓到了害他受傷的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-02","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想當語言教師，得先考取教師證書，將來找工作較順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-11","sourceFront":"考取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"做事不順利時別只想著逃避，得好好面對才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-20","sourceFront":"面對","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他順利當上那家大飯店的廚師後，好多朋友都打電話祝賀他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-27","sourceFront":"祝賀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過這次手術，得了重病的嬰兒終於順利地保住了生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-32","sourceFront":"保","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"申請簽證的表格請填完整資料，以免無法順利申請。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-21","sourceFront":"完整","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"裁判的工作是確定每位選手都遵守規定，讓比賽順利進行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-25","sourceFront":"裁判","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-2-19\",\"方式\",\"方式\",\"方式\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你打算用什麼方式慶祝父親六十歲的生日？","pinyin":"Nǐ dǎsuàn yòng shénme fāngshì qìngzhù fùqīn liùshí suì de shēngrì?","english":"What way do you plan to use to celebrate your father's 60th birthday?","sourceCardId":"B2L08-2-19","sourceFront":"方式","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"用不同的方法教育不同的學生，這樣才是成功的教育方式。","pinyin":"Yòng bùtóng de fāngfǎ jiàoyù bùtóng de xuéshēng, zhèyàng cái shì chénggōng de jiàoyù fāngshì.","english":"Educating different students with different methods—this is the successful way of education.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-25","sourceFront":"教育","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張教授上課的方式很活潑，所以很多學生要選他的課。","pinyin":"Zhāng jiàoshòu shàngkè de fāngshì hěn huópō, suǒyǐ hěn duō xuésheng yào xuǎn tā de kè.","english":"Professor Zhang's teaching style is very lively, so many students want to take his class.","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-15","sourceFront":"活潑","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個明星演戲前都會先研究戲裡的人物、故事，最後才決定表演的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-04","sourceFront":"演戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"青少年常因為不了解而誤會父母的教育方式，或許等他們長大了，就能真正明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-24","sourceFront":"真正","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王小姐用網路交友的方式，找到了理想的結婚對象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-01","sourceFront":"交友","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:對這次新產品的銷售方式，你有什麼想法？ B:我在這方面沒什麼經驗，你可以去請教方經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-07","sourceFront":"方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代人往往以網路傳訊息，代替傳統寫信或打電話的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-15","sourceFront":"往往","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以電腦系統取代傳統收停車費的方式，能幫老闆節省工作人員的費用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-05","sourceFront":"系統","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如想通過那家企業的面試，就得先熟悉他們的產品特色與銷售方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-18","sourceFront":"如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於雲端科技的進步，人類的生活方式跟以往比起來有很大的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-07","sourceFront":"由於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個國家打招呼的方式都不太一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-07","sourceFront":"打招呼","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物網站會把常見的購物問題及處理方式放在網頁上，提供給顧客參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-03","sourceFront":"常見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他利用發傳單的方式來宣傳自己新開的餐廳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-23","sourceFront":"傳單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人送禮最重心意，以這種方式向收禮的人表達關心與祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-16","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在路邊的攤子享受小吃，得注意他們處理食物的方式衛不衛生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-28","sourceFront":"衛生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電視臺常在熱門比賽的轉播中放一些廣告，靠這種方式來賺錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-12","sourceFront":"轉播","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"逃避或許是解決問題的一種方式，但有些問題是你逃不了，不得不解決的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-12","sourceFront":"逃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在去醫院拿藥，藥袋上都會把藥方及使用方式寫得很清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-12","sourceFront":"藥方","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事忍耐一下就過去了，什麼都想以吵架的方式解決，遲早會出事的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-14","sourceFront":"出事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"貓很享受抓癢，但要是你抓錯地方或方式不對，反而會使貓發脾氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-54","sourceFront":"抓癢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在自由戀愛的時代中，還是有人透過相親的方式來認識另一半。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-11","sourceFront":"相親","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"企業為了錄用合適的人才，而採用各式各樣的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-21","sourceFront":"錄用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次畢業典禮，學校打算採用空拍的方式來拍紀念影片。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-03","sourceFront":"空拍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這套陶瓷茶具是專家以手工方式做的，因此價格也不便宜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-19","sourceFront":"陶瓷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"保存食物的方式會影響食物的新鮮程度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-22","sourceFront":"保存","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你別怪他老是抱怨你的開車方式，他也是怕你撞著了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-32","sourceFront":"撞","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我旅行的方式很隨意，出發前從不先規劃行程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-34","sourceFront":"隨意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這位記者專門報導社會新聞，他報新聞的方式相當專業。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-02","sourceFront":"報","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們打算用擲銅錢的方式，來決定讓誰處理這件事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-04","sourceFront":"擲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-2-19\",\"乐观\",\"樂觀\",\"乐观\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"陳可欣是一個勇敢、樂觀的人，什麼麻煩、困難的問題都不怕。","pinyin":"Chén Kěxīn shì yí ge yǒnggǎn, lèguān de rén, shénme máfan, kùnnan de wèntí dōu bú pà.","english":"Chen Kexin is a brave and optimistic person; she is not afraid of any troublesome or difficult problems.","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-19","sourceFront":"樂觀","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"一般人都喜歡跟性格溫柔、樂觀的人交朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-08","sourceFront":"性格","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥的性格開朗、樂觀，遇到麻煩也不會往壞處想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-09","sourceFront":"開朗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-24\",\"同样\",\"同樣\",\"同样\",\"Adv/Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"林媽媽總是給她的雙胞胎女兒穿同樣顏色、同樣大小的衣服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-24","sourceFront":"同樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"source