\",\"无法\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"誰都無法告訴你生命的意義是什麼，只能自己去尋找答案。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-07","sourceFront":"無法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有一些研究科學的人，對不科學、無法合理解釋的現象都不太相信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-12","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"昨天棒球賽進行到一半時突然下起了大雨，雖然後來雨停了，但因為球場太溼，也無法繼續比賽了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-16","sourceFront":"進行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"學習是別人無法代你去做的，得親自來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-20","sourceFront":"代","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們無法決定生命的長度，卻能夠決定生活的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-09","sourceFront":"長度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"假如缺乏陽光、空氣和水這三項條件，植物就無法生長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-10","sourceFront":"生長","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個國家光是依靠免費簽證，是無法吸引國外遊客來旅行的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-32","sourceFront":"光是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"七歲以下的孩子對手部動作還無法完全地掌握，因此不應要求他們正確地握筆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-32","sourceFront":"握","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"碰到困難無法繼續前進時，暫時後退等待機會也是一種作法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-21","sourceFront":"後退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的電腦無法上網，檢查之後才發現網路線沒有接著電腦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-04","sourceFront":"接","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們無法控制別人的行為，卻能夠改變自己的想法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-21","sourceFront":"控制","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果遇到無法處理的心理問題，最好請專業人員來輔導。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-02","sourceFront":"輔導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我從沒去過澳洲，無法想像那裡的景色有多美。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-08","sourceFront":"從沒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時一個人的前途無法先規劃好，必須自己創造。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-12","sourceFront":"前途","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"鑽石因為無法大量出產，所以才變得珍貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-37","sourceFront":"鑽石","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天天說自己外行、不願嘗試的人，就無法更深入地瞭解世界。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-08","sourceFront":"外行","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"各行各業都有屬於自己的專業，無法比較誰高誰低。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-10","sourceFront":"專業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"動不動就發脾氣的人，往往無法接受別人的寶貴建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-33","sourceFront":"動不動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果不與別人競爭，你就無法進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-33","sourceFront":"競爭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的電腦系統無法升級，所以很多功能都不能使用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-08","sourceFront":"升級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"申請簽證的表格請填完整資料，以免無法順利申請。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-21","sourceFront":"完整","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，有人說夏天開冷氣不如開除溼機，不過有專家表示，它們的功能無法互相取代。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-22","sourceFront":"除溼機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場棒球比賽已打到最後一局，可是仍無法看出誰輸誰贏。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-48","sourceFront":"局","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"情侶之間如果無法相信彼此，很容易就分手了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-16","sourceFront":"彼此","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Having 無(no) trace of 法(law): 無法 means unable, incapable."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-24\",\"当场\",\"當場\",\"当场\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個小偷趁著觀眾看表演的時候偷東西，結果當場就被安全人員抓了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-24","sourceFront":"當場","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他的頭部被棒球打中並當場昏迷，還好幾分鐘後就醒過來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-06","sourceFront":"昏迷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張小姐很膽小，看到車禍現場有人流了很多血，當場就昏倒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-07","sourceFront":"昏倒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-31\",\"哎哟\",\"哎喲\",\"哎哟\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"哎喲，已經半夜一點多了！我們就別再加班寫產品計畫了，等明天再繼續吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-31","sourceFront":"哎喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-22\",\"腫\",\"腫\",\"肿\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"醫生說，要是睡前喝了太多水，早上起來時臉就會有點兒腫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-22","sourceFront":"腫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這桌喜酒有很多海鮮，但我只能吃魚，其他種類的海鮮都會讓我皮膚紅腫(inflamed)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-48","sourceFront":"海鮮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-29\",\"汗\",\"汗\",\"汗\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"對夏天一活動汗就流個不停的女性來說，化妝實在是件麻煩事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-29","sourceFront":"汗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"早上在草地上散步，突然看見一條蛇經過，害得我一直流冷汗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-28","sourceFront":"冷汗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"夏天的時候容易流汗，讓衣服變得黏黏的，真不舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-40","sourceFront":"黏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我不太喜歡流很多汗，所以不常跑步，比較喜歡在公園散步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-20","sourceFront":"流汗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"The 氵(water) beads on your skin turn 干(dry) as they evaporate, leaving the salt of 汗(perspiration)."},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-09\",\"电子\",\"電子\",\"电子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"公司不斷推銷新型電子產品，通常是為了刺激客戶購買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-09","sourceFront":"電子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"她在電子工廠上班，難怪拆機器的技術非常熟練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-09","sourceFront":"熟練","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別看張老闆平日吃的、用的都很省，其實他是某家大型電子企業的老闆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-17","sourceFront":"省","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著電子產業發展，人們的生活習慣也受到很深的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-06","sourceFront":"產業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們公司在這次電子展共發表了九項新產品，並吸引不少國外客戶來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-13","sourceFront":"共","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-10\",\"早晚\",\"早晚\",\"早晚\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了發展工業而不斷開發，這樣下去森林早晚會被破壞光的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-10","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我常跟電腦下棋，因為想玩就玩，不必擔心時間早晚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-49","sourceFront":"下棋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了在這場鋼琴演奏中有優秀的表現，小戴早晚不停地練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-05","sourceFront":"演奏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"秋天的天氣變化很大，早晚都有點涼，出門時最好帶件外套。 這碗魚湯要趁熱喝，涼了就不好喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-22","sourceFront":"涼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小韓早晚都打工，是因為想多存一些錢，早一點完成出國念書的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-09","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"Combining 早(early) and 晚(night): 早晚 means morning and evening."},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-36\",\"幅\",\"幅\",\"幅\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這幅設計圖畫得很仔細，畫圖的人應該相當細心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-36","sourceFront":"幅","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這幅名畫每日吸引了上千位遊客前來博物館欣賞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-14","sourceFront":"前來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"冷淡\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 冷(cold) and 淡(light): 冷淡 means cold, frigid."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"司\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 一(one) 口(mouth) barks orders at the gate → 司(take charge of)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"合歡山\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"合(combine) + 歡(happy) + 山(mountain) → Hehuan Mountain, a mountain of shared joy."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"愛情\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 愛(love) a 情(feeling): 愛情 means love."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"招待\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 招(summon) and 待(entertain): 招待 means treat."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"書\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A steady hand takes a 肀(brush) to write 一(one) line above the 日(sun) → a new 書(book)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"玉米\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 玉(jade) and 米(rice): 玉米 means corn."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"相\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 木(tree) branch frames a 目(eye) staring back → 相(photo)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"結婚\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"結(knot) + 婚(marriage): tying the knot is getting married."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"衣服\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"衣(garment) + 服(clothing) → 衣服 is what you wear."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"觸\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A beetle arches its sharp 角(angle) horn to ram a crawling 蜀(caterpillar) in a head-on 觸(butt)."}]}
